0 FILE 10190 - Car port.ldr
0 Car port structure on a 16x32 baseplate: tiled and grille floor, tan brick walls with headlight bricks, dark-blue arched gate with barred left/right gates, hinged roof, lamp, flag, owl detail, control sticks and whips, with storage baskets, cabbage and cherries
0 Name: 10190 - Car port.ldr
